    End Function

    ''' <summary>
    ''' Number of monic irreducible polynomials of degree <c>d</c> over GF(p), by Gauss's formula
    ''' </summary>
    ''' <remarks>
    ''' <para><c>I_d=\frac1d\sum_{e\mid d}\mu(d/e)\,p^{e}</c>, as a double (exact while below 2^53).</para>
    ''' <para><c>I_d</c>.</para>
    ''' </remarks>
    ''' <param name="p">a prime.</param>
    ''' <param name="d">degree, at least 1.</param>
