    End Function

    ''' <summary>
    ''' Expected number of distinct monic irreducible factors of a uniformly random monic
    ''' polynomial of degree <c>n</c> over GF(p): each irreducible g of degree d &lt;= n divides it with
    ''' probability
    ''' </summary>
    ''' <remarks>
    ''' <para><c>p^{-d}</c>, so the expectation is <c>\sum_{d=1}^{n}I_d\,p^{-d}\approx H_n</c>.</para>
    ''' </remarks>
