    ''' <remarks>
    ''' <para>The first of: <c>$DATAMUNGE_DATA_DIR</c>; <c>$XDG_CACHE_HOME/datamunge/datasets</c>;
    ''' <c>$HOME/.cache/datamunge/datasets</c>; on Windows <c>%LOCALAPPDATA%/datamunge/datasets</c>;
    ''' otherwise <c>build/datasets</c> relative to the working directory. Nothing is created.</para>
    ''' <para><b>Example</b></para>
    ''' <code>
    ''' std::print("{}\n", dm::datasets::data_home());   // e.g. /home/me/.cache/datamunge/datasets
    ''' </code>
    ''' <para>See also: <c>fetch()</c>.</para>
